OL,5,G2000 Bangers & Cash: Restoring Classics
OL,6,     FAllegro/Corsa: The team acquire an
OL,7,     F80s Austin Allegro and soon find
OL,8,     Fout how it got the nickname 'all
OL,9,     Faggro'. Next, they take on a DIY
OL,10,     Fproject to save some cash with a
OL,11,     F90s Vauxhall Corsa.
OL,12,G2100 Dream Car Fixers
OL,13,     FRover: Sheldon and Peter are
OL,14,     Ftasked with the ultimate challenge
OL,15,     F- a classic car that's reliable
OL,16,     Fenough for everyday use. They take
OL,17,     Fon the first ever European Car of
OL,18,     Fthe Year, a Rover P6.
